IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `avr-rules`

-- Independent tests, from independent-expectations.md (written before reading the rules).

§ `Independent tests`

GIVEN c IS A `Veteran case`
GIVETH A `Veteran position`
pos c MEANS `the veteran position for` c

GIVEN c IS A `Veteran case`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
due c MEANS (pos c)'s `committed decision date for my MRC Act claim`

-- 1: served in the Permanent Forces, discharged
#ASSERT (pos (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING))'s `I am a veteran` EQUALS TRUE
-- 2: serving Reserves member
#ASSERT (pos (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, JUST (Date 1 3 2024), NOTHING))'s `I am a veteran` EQUALS TRUE
-- 3: never served
#ASSERT (pos (`Veteran case` OF FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING))'s `I am a veteran` EQUALS FALSE
-- 4: received 1 Mar 2024, no s 330 request: last day 29 May 2024
#ASSERT due (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, JUST (Date 1 3 2024), NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 29 5 2024)
-- 5: requested information received 15 Apr 2024: last day 13 Jul 2024
#ASSERT due (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, JUST (Date 1 3 2024), JUST (Date 15 4 2024)) EQUALS JUST (Date 13 7 2024)
-- 6: received 1 Dec 2023, crosses leap February: 28 Feb 2024
#ASSERT due (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, JUST (Date 1 12 2023), NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 28 2 2024)
-- 7: information earlier than the claim: claim day is the later: 7 Sep 2024
#ASSERT due (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, JUST (Date 10 6 2024), JUST (Date 3 6 2024)) EQUALS JUST (Date 7 9 2024)
-- extra: same-day receipt
#ASSERT due (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, JUST (Date 10 6 2024), JUST (Date 10 6 2024)) EQUALS JUST (Date 7 9 2024)
-- no claim: no date
#ASSERT due (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- 9: Part 2 not enforceable, in every case
#ASSERT (pos (`Veteran case` OF TRUE, JUST (Date 1 3 2024), NOTHING))'s `Part 2 is enforceable` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT (pos (`Veteran case` OF FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING))'s `Part 2 is enforceable` EQUALS FALSE
-- 8 (non-MRC claims), 10/11 (s 9 pins) cannot be expressed: no inputs or outputs for them.
